<text x="114.3" y="426.72" size="1.778" layer="114">PIC SPI NAMING CONVENTIONS
---------------------------------------------
CLOCK ............................... SCK
DATA IN ............................. SDI
DATA OUT .......................... SDO
CHIP SELECT (SLAVE SELECT) ... SS</text>
<text x="71.12" y="58.42" size="1.778" layer="114" align="bottom-right">SUPPLY:
5 - 30 VDC
@ 10mA</text>
<text x="190.5" y="243.586" size="1.778" layer="114" align="bottom-center">(10mA max)</text>
